{"id": "Dcgdhd_vinC", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLAUDE\" to get these 5 plugins and skills for your Claude Code Setup.\n\nIf you're using Claude Code, you need to install these 5 AI plugins and skills.\n\nFirst is find-skills.\n\nYou just tell it what you're building.\n\nIt searches its whole library of 100k skills.\n\nIt finds the best ones and installs them for you.\n\nSecond is OmniRoute.\n\nIt gives your Claude Code almost unlimited usage by connecting to over 200 free AI providers.\n\nThe moment your usage limit runs out, it automatically switches you to the next best model.\n\nGiving you up to 1.6 billion free tokens every single month.\n\nThird is Claude Code Setup.\n\nIt's an official Anthropic plugin.\n\nIt scans your entire codebase and recommends the best hooks, skills, subagents, and MCP servers that fit your project.\n\nAnd it removes the useless stuff you don't need.\n\nFourth is Strix.\n\nIt attacks your vibe coded app like a real hacker.\n\nIt finds and fixes any security vulnerabilities left behind.\n\nAnd finally, Agent Reach.\n\nIt lets you scrape anything off the internet, even gated platforms like LinkedIn, Instagram, X, and Reddit.\n\nWithout any API key required.\n\n#claudecode #claudeskills #claudeplugins #omniroute #agentreach", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1787755733, "like_count": 3742, "comment_count": 5319, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-902797559189435a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.583, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOrYc_6X3EvqwLdLuno2IW9LdtN0KfuftV5g6z-ipp6Lx81LjOtWxT-cyOWkyHERj3TOh96wtNBySfVrnVxgrMSIeCVbRbES-V6kXM.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdqEv4a8lN-723w-0n5nRXqhALe2nDxzGE_N2dlegNYQiBCrEYnnCd6f2ZDccMtmSHg&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd